# Clearing security

LLM tools may receive a URL only. Deterministic code owns payee, amount, token contract, network,
task budget, nonce, and idempotency.

- Demo synthetic receipts: `/api/clearing/demo/*` only
- Testnet: PostgreSQL + HMAC + official facilitator verify/settle
- Mainnet: gated release; public `x402.org` facilitator is forbidden
- Never trust a ticker. Pin CAIP-2 + canonical contract
- Card/FX quotes are paper-only and never include PAN
- After changes: `npm run test:nexus` and `npm run test:clearing`; report skipped postgres tests
See `docs/CURSOR_GUIDE.md` and `.cursor/rules/a2a-payment-verification.mdc`.
